        "openmrs_entity": "concept",
        "openmrs_entity_id": "",
        "openmrs_data_type": "select one",
        "type": "label",
        "text": "\n• Tiredness \n•  Light Stool/Diarrhoea\n• A feeling of pressure in the pelvis or lower belly.\n•  Vaginal spotting or light bleeding\n• Labor Contractions - Strong and regular contractions \n• A gush or an ongoing trickle of fluid from the vagina\n• Frequent Urination"
